      "created_at": "2014-03-28T22:04:43.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So the new Chemical Explosion says*</p><p><em>Destroy all vat cards.</em></p><p><em>Deal each target X toxic damage, where X = the number of cards destroyed by this card plus 3.</em></p><p><em>At the end of the environment card, destroy this card.</em></p><p>which got me thinking.</p><p>The card does not specify VAT cards destroyed, just cards destroyed. If Chemical Explosion reduces a target to 0, thus destroying it, would the damage increase by 1? Literal reading would have you increase the damage but I'm not sure if the intent is for the wave to get bigger as it goes. Opinions?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>*and I really do miss that extra C</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:40:56.629Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
