      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/j/c37758/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2014-03-28T22:08:56.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The damage is very clearly intended to be dependent on the number of vats destroyed, and only dependent on the number of vats destroyed.</p><p>I suppose you COULD rule that the damage increases as targets die by a particularly pedantic reading of RAW, but I don't think that's a good idea.</p>",
